# `modules/__AOH_MODULE_NAME__/deploy/`

Deployment artifacts for the __AOH_MODULE_NAME__ Go service
(`modules/__AOH_MODULE_NAME__/service/`).

## Contents

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `compose.snippet.yml` | Composable compose snippet — brings up `__AOH_MODULE_NAME__-db` (Postgres) + `__AOH_MODULE_NAME__-service`. Designed to merge into a hub-level stack via `docker compose -f core.yml -f modules/__AOH_MODULE_NAME__/deploy/compose.snippet.yml up`. |
| `README.md` | This file. |

The Go service's own Dockerfile lives at
`modules/__AOH_MODULE_NAME__/service/Dockerfile` (next to its source).
This `deploy/` directory is for **deployment composition** artifacts
that reference the service from the outside (compose snippets, Helm
chart skeletons, Kubernetes manifests, etc.).
